{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "name": "replay-unknown-holds-firing",
  "description": "an unknown met under hold leaves the firing state as it is and clears no timers: rule 1 keeps firing through the gap at 12:05 and clears on the known false at 12:15; rule 2\u0027s sustained run survives the gap and holds at 12:10; rule 3 (not_met) clears at the gap, and rule 4 (met) fires at it",
